{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">圈中模範夫妻陳煒（煒哥）與醫美醫生老公陳國強（Aldous）一直恩愛如昔！日前（26日）正是兩人結婚4周年的大日子，兩口子特意飛到韓國旅行慶祝，煒哥更在社交網大放閃光彈！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-09-28 at 10.21.03 AM.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261b0dIGDIc21790570427.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-09-28 at 10.21.03 AM.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">煒哥在社交網大晒多張甜蜜合照，相中見到煒哥化身小鳥依人，甜蜜地依偎在老公的肩膀上，流露出幸福的笑容。她更公開向老公發表愛的宣言：「9月26號，我哋結婚四周年啦，雖然唔算好耐，但係往後日子仲有好長，放心我會繼續陪你去茶餐廳食早餐，得閒接你放工，同你睇戲，煮好嘢俾你食，講得出就做得到，因為我係你最錫嘅老婆，Honey I love you forever！」字裏行間充滿着貼地的浪漫，令人超羨慕！</span><br/><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"alicechanwai_1790435683_3994780042308943112_1743590929.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026PduI6nCJpP1790570427.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"alicechanwai_1790435683_3994780042308943112_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了愛的宣言，慶祝的佈置亦非常花心思！桌上擺放了插有數字「4」蠟燭的蛋糕、兩人的Q版手繪畫像、美麗的鮮花，仲有可愛的恐龍與Miffy毛公仔，旁邊更放置了代表紀念日的「926」日期積木，儀式感滿分。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"alicechanwai_1790435683_3994780045588856086_1743590929.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lOdQvwPiyK1790570706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"alicechanwai_1790435683_3994780045588856086_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">煒哥接受 </span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">tvb.com</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 獨家訪問時，更開心 share 兩人在韓國的甜蜜點滴。她透露今次行程主打「Free Style」，行到邊食到邊：「每年結婚周年都會去旅行慶祝，所有嘢都冇特別去plan。」兩人除了緊貼潮流去影「人生四格照」之外，煒哥更大爆老公的童真一面：「最驚喜係老公喺聖水洞發現有龍珠館，佢玩得好開心！」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-09-28 at 10.21.03 AM-3.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20266zPQulunsc1790570428.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-09-28 at 10.21.03 AM-3.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"alicechanwai_1790569314_3995907432267463844_1743590929.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CEY8omC6SG1790570426.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"alicechanwai_1790569314_3995907432267463844_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T05:39:25.963911+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":540,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}